    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "定理7. 如果两个平行平面与第三个平面相交，那么所得的交线平行。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 30,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0037#11"
      ],
      "source_text": "定理7. 如果两个平行平面和第三个平面相交，那么交线平行.",
      "changes": ["modernized", "layout"],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "已知：\n$\\alpha\\mathbin{//}\\beta$，\n$\\gamma\\cap\\alpha=a$，\n$\\gamma\\cap\\beta=b$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 31,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0038#1"
      ],
      "source_text": "已知：$\\alpha\\mathbin{//}\\beta$，$\\gamma\\cap\\alpha=a$，$\\gamma\\cap\\beta=b$.",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "求证：\n$a\\mathbin{//}b$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 31,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0038#2"
      ],
      "source_text": "求证：$a\\mathbin{//}b$.",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "请自行证明（图 33），只需研究平面 $\\alpha$ 和 $\\beta$ 不相同的情形。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 31,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0038#3"
      ],
      "source_text": "由同学自己证明（图 33）. 仅研究当平面 $\\alpha$ 和 $\\beta$ 不相同时的情况.",
      "changes": ["modernized", "layout"],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
